    "text": "Based on today\u2019s discussion, my role in the education system would be to facilitate holistic development by ensuring that learning goes beyond mere physical facilities. I would focus on nurturing relationships and fostering the right understanding within students, helping them progress from an animal consciousness\u2014relying only on material needs\u2014to a human consciousness that balances physical needs, social connections, and self\u2011awareness.",
